            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "……なんでい、こっちをじーっと見て。",
            "enText": "…What? Why ya starin' at me like that?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 9089116527357438997,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "もしかして、お前さんも\r\nあたしを小せえって言いたいのか。",
            "enText": "Lemme guess, ye're holdin' back from \ncommenting on how small I am.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -8218790313114197408,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "あっはっはっはっは！\r\nくだらねえなあ、そんなこと！",
            "enText": "Ahahaha! I couldn't care less, not one bit!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 9221402567419220549,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イナリワン",
            "enName": "Inari One",
            "jpText": "デカさはてめえの心意気次第。\nデカくなろうと思えば、いくらでも\nデカくなれんのさ！",
            "enText": "Size isn't just 'bout stature — it's about \nattitude. If ya set your mind to being big, \nyou can be as big as ya want!",
